  "title": "Tostones (Twice-Fried Green Plantains) with Mayo Ketchup Dipping Sauce",
  "description": "These tostones with dipping sauce feature crispy, twice-fried smashed plantain chunks and a simple, chilled dip of mayonnaise, ketchup, and garlic.",
